The embedded font name table also contains this notice:

    (c) Copyright Avector Tech. Ltd. 1996

Academia Sinica's release statement offers the Chinese Character Assembling
Fonts, when treated as separate works, under either the GNU Free Documentation
License 1.2 or the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.5 Taiwan license.
This package elects the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.5 Taiwan
option.

Canonical license URI:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5/tw/

The exact upstream release statement in Chinese and English is included in
UPSTREAM-LICENSE.md. The exact PDF copy of the legal code linked by that
release statement is included in LICENSE.CC-BY-SA-2.5-TW.pdf.

The font data is unmodified. Only the filename extensions have changed from
.tte to .ttf after validation that both files are standard TrueType sfnt fonts.
See NOTICE.md for attribution and SOURCE.md for provenance and checksums.
